	(title_block (title "MeshSat Field Kit carrier - PCB-A POWER + I/O") (date "2026-09-04") (rev "A") (company "MeshSat") (comment 1 "Phase A2 schematic (A4: 16.3 fixes), generated by tools/gen_sch_a.py. Netlist style: every pin carries a stub and a net label.") (comment 2 "MESHSAT-709 / MESHSAT-789. A19 (4 Sep 2026 rulings, appendix 32.13 to 32.25): the kit UPS. BQ25792 charger from the dock 12 V, BQ34Z100-G1 gauge, three TPS61288L rails (M1, M2, Pi), LTC2954 main power control, TPS259571 heating-pad switch, USB2517I seven-port hub with the wall host port, PCA9555 0x21 and 0x24, seven SMP-MAX blind-mate sites, 9 A power pins to the floor battery module. No X1202."))
